#: qml/ConfigGeneral.qml:175
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Look for a setting in <application>%1</application> to disable its tray icon "
"before doing it here. Some apps’ tray icons were not designed to be "
"disabled, and using this setting may cause them to behave unexpectedly.<nl/"
"><nl/>Use this setting at your own risk, and do not report issues to KDE or "
"the app’s author."
msgstr ""
"Pre nego što to uradite ovde, potražite u programu <application>%1</"
"application> postavku za isključivanje njegove kasetne ikonice. Kasetne "
"ikonice nekih programa nisu predviđene za isključivanje, pa ova postavka "
"može da izazove njihovo neočekivano ponašanje.<nl/><nl/>Ovu postavku "
"koristite na sopstvenu odgovornost i ne prijavljujte probleme ni KDE‑u ni "
"autoru programa."

#: qml/ConfigGeneral.qml:178
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "I understand the risks"
msgstr "Razumem rizike"

#: qml/ConfigGeneral.qml:190
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Disabling the clipboard is not recommended, as it will cause copied data to "
"be lost when the application it was copied from is closed.<nl/><nl/>Only do "
"this if you’ve manually added a standalone Clipboard widget somewhere else, "
"or are using a 3rd-party clipboard manager. Also, instead consider "
"configuring the clipboard to not save history, or to only remember one item "
"at a time."
msgstr ""
"Ne preporučuje se isključivanje klipborda, jer će se kopirani podaci "
"izgubiti kada se zatvori program iz koga su kopirani.<nl/><nl/>Uradite ovo "
"samo ako ste ručno dodali samostalan vidžet klipborda negde drugde ili ako "
"koristite menadžer klipborda treće strane. Razmislite i da umesto toga "
"podesite klipbord da ne čuva istorijat ili da pamti samo jednu stavku."

#: qml/ConfigGeneral.qml:199
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Disabling the Notifications widget is not recommended, as notifications sent "
"by apps will no longer be shown.<nl/><nl/>Only do this if you’ve manually "
"added a standalone Notifications widget somewhere else, or are intentionally "
"using a 3rd-party notification manager to handle notifications."
msgstr ""
"Ne preporučuje se isključivanje vidžeta obaveštenja, jer se obaveštenja koja "
"šalju programi više neće prikazivati.<nl/><nl/>Uradite ovo samo ako ste "
"ručno dodali samostalan vidžet obaveštenja negde drugde ili ako namerno "
"koristite menadžer obaveštenja treće strane."

